# The Xerox Smalltalk-80 virtual image, its sources, and the Xerox reference
# execution traces.  These carry no license grant from any host -- not
# Wolczko's site, not the archive.org mirror.  They are used here as a
# private development oracle only and must never be committed or
# redistributed.  See doc/LICENSING.md.
oracle/

# The bootstrapped image is a build product.
*.image
*.changes

# Screenshots of the Xerox image reproduce its content, which carries the
# same absent license grant as the image itself.  See doc/LICENSING.md.
smalltalk-desktop.*
screen*.pbm

# -screenshot writes the antialiasing coverage plane beside the .pbm, so the
# window's own output can be checked without a window.  Same reasoning.
screen*.cov

# Rendered copies of documents whose source is already tracked.  The Markdown
# under doc/ is the original; a PDF of it is a second copy to keep in step
# and no reader of this repository needs one.
*.pdf
